  <Document>
    <name>Kolkata Durga Pujo Guide by The Pujo Company</name>
    <description><![CDATA[A Map to the Popular Durga Pujo Mandaps in Kolkata.<br> These Durga Puja celebrations have been conducted in the ancestral homes of Kolkata for generations. They have a distinct and traditional flavor of celebrations of Durga Puja in public pandals.<br>Filter Options:<br>1. Iconic Pujos of Kolkata<br>2. Bonedi Barir Pujo<br>3. North Kolkata r Pujo<br>4. South Kolkata r Pujo<br>5. Salt Lake er Pujo<br><br> Brought to you by the Pujo Company]]></description>
